* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
*   SCREEN SIZE RETURNING v
*
*   is compiled into
*
*   call !screen_size(ret, status)
*
*   ret is the width, a field mark, the height, in character cells as the terminal is now
*   (@CRTWIDE and @CRTHIGH), whether or not SCREEN OPEN has been done.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
subroutine screen_size(ret, status)
$catalog !screen_size

   ret = @crtwide : @fm : @crthigh
   status = 0

   return
end

